# Build context for Containerfile: an allowlist of the Go sources in src/ only. Anything else in src/ (config.yml,
# config.yml.dist, .claude/, notes) never reaches the build; the Containerfile fails the build if it does.
*
!src/go.mod
!src/go.sum
!src/cmd/
!src/internal/
!src/vendor/
# Never, even inside the allowed directories: tool and editor folders (Claude Code creates .claude/ where it works).
**/.claude
**/.idea
